  <section id="rooms">
    <h2>Room types, sizes and beds</h2>
    <p>Rooms are in two neighborhoods. Official listings put Standard Location rooms in Magnolia Bend, and put the "5th Sleeper" rooms in Alligator Bayou. Preferred rooms can be in either neighborhood and are listed as close to the Sassagoula Steamboat Company, dining, shopping and transportation. Royal Guest Rooms are a more themed category in Magnolia Bend. King rooms can be in either neighborhood.</p>
