  <section id="dining">
    <h2>Dining</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Riverside Mill Food Court</strong> is the quick-service restaurant for breakfast, lunch and dinner.</li>
      <li><strong>Boatwright's Dining Hall</strong> is the table-service restaurant, listed for dinner in a Disney travel-agent overview. Confirm current hours before you go <span class="verify">[verify hours still current]</span>.</li>
      <li><strong>Muddy Rivers</strong> is the pool bar at Ol' Man Island.</li>
      <li>Port Orleans French Quarter, next door, has its own food court. Scat Cat's Club on that side is under refurbishment into late 2026 and early 2027.</li>
      <li>You can use mobile ordering in the My Disney Experience app at the quick-service spots.</li>
      <li><strong>Park dining reservations:</strong> Disney resort guests can book their whole stay (up to 10 nights) starting 60 days before arrival.</li>
    </ul>
    <span class="ryan">[Ryan: your go-to meal here, and one thing you'd skip.]</span>
